en:
Thank you. Then, since we don't want to startle the Gururu,
let's observe them from a little distance. Also, I hear that if you stare too long,
our own faces start to look like a Gururu's.

Then I'll tell you a secret... I read it in the Village Chief's book—
if you head straight toward where Tana rises, 
you'll find your way home, heh heh!

I wanted to come out right away, but
if a Great Fairy like me showed up in such a remote village,
it'd cause a huge fuss, so I waited for the right moment...

I've caught glimpses of it before, but...
if Sunya Corruption is spreading over such a large area,
this is going to turn into a catastrophe before long!
